 on 30</em>\, <em>First Date</em>)\, <em>Galileo</em> is directed by Tony&r
 eg\; winner Michael Mayer (<em>American Idiot</em>\, <em>Spring Awakening<
 /em>) and choreographed by Tony&reg\; nominee David Neumann (<em>Hadestown
 </em>\, <em>Swept Away</em>).</p>
